{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjZLdNXgtF6DXQkinqaS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LfMWLqx2K9WxBDaDiYoaR6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='labs/game/hub/session.ts'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    hub.on('card', ((card: Session['card']) => {\"\"\",\"\"\"    // The card's keys work from the first moment: the harness sends a synthetic Enter, as soon as it sees ready.\n    addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\n      if (this.started) return;\n      if (event.code === 'Enter' || event.code === 'NumpadEnter') this.answer('ready');\n      if (event.code === 'KeyT') this.answer('more');\n    });\n    hub.on('card', ((card: Session['card']) => {\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  engine: Engine | null = null;\n\"\"\",\"\"\"  engine: Engine | null = null;\n\n  /** Answers the card. */\n  answer(what: 'ready' | 'more'): void {\n    if (this.started) return;\n    if (what === 'ready') this.answered = true;\n    this.hub.answer(what);\n  }\n\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='labs/game/ui/app.ts'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      this.session.answered = false;\n      addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\n        if (event.code === 'Enter' && !this.session?.started) this.session?.hub.answer('ready');\n      });\n\"\"\",\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"## Status\")\ns=s[:a]+\"\"\"## Decisions so far (also put them in labs/game/README.md at the end)\n- One data-driven camera `cam3=shot` (cameras/shot.ts) aimed by the page each frame (ui/shots.ts), instead of one mode per activity.\n- Session scene game:round spawns NO props at all (engine warms a pipeline per registered prop part when first prop arrives: 40-90 s on SwiftShader, past the hub deadline). Floor/mats/hoops = telegraphs; pillars = stand-in block stacks; ground = terrain:round. main.ts dynamically imports scenes/round OR scenes/island so props register only for the island. Session uses gfx.warmUp=asked. Boot ~10 s.\n- Island boot on SwiftShader ~34 s with ?gfx.warmUp=asked. Tests use that.\n- Direct writes to sceneProp x/y/z/q work for body-less props.\n- Engine trap: inside an action or step, spawn/despawn are queued to the boundary. Activity entity is permanent (id '' = none).\n\n## Tools\n- `node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs out/game.html` builds; `python3 labs/game/tools/peek.py out/game.html \"?query\" out/a.png 9000 \"js\"`; `python3 labs/game/tools/boottime.py`; `python3 labs/game/tools/hubcheck.py out/game.html 2 3 4 3:host-leave`.\n- Balance: `TEETER_SEEDS=2 TEETER_SHOW=1 TEETER_ONLY=pond npx vitest run labs/game/scenes/balance.test.ts`\n- Debug run: labs/game/scenes/debug.test.ts (EV=x SKILL=y) - DELETE at end.\n\n## Status\n- [x] workspace, core wobble, seats, flow, director(partial), scoring, kit, ring, morning, pose (A/B/C/heron), pond, group, round scene, hub harness nearly passing, props, materials, bodies, builds, clips, look, sky\n- [ ] sim: reps, step, line, paddle, garden, plunge, hoop, jog, tilt (finale + ending), usables wired\n- [ ] page: ui/app.ts is a stub! needs screens (title, pier, programme, noticeboard, results, evening, pause, settings, controls, about, dev, attract, credits, touch-only, hub card), HUD (disc etc), glyphs, shots, audio (voice, songs, sfx), lines (200+), emitters, rumble, mouse lean, group pads\n- [ ] tests: verify.mjs, browser tests, replays\n- [ ] reports: about-data, README, ENGINE-FEEDBACK, exit-interview, final build to work/ root\n\n## Test tally (for the exit interview)\n- issues caught: 6 (duplicate prop id; action-map move names; prop placement shape; boot past hub deadline; Enter listener too late; auto director leaving results early). critical: 2 (boot deadline, placement crash)\n- Engine feedback notes: prop batches registered for all props -> warm-up cost; `new` docs; ActionMap requires move actions even when empty; defineTerrain origin 3 numbers; spawnProp placement {prop,at,yaw} differs from plan guess; plan's client sha outdated.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n 1,40p engine/world/telegraphs.ts | grep -n \"alpha\\|color\" | head -5 | cut -c1-160","description":"Move card keys into the session and update progress notes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5649,"cache_read_input_tokens":409341,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5649},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dd98077-2f1f-4b79-bf36-2031f176f317","uuid":"1d5547f2-607f-47f7-b918-5af3e4000702","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:39:13.449Z","request_id":"req_011CgjZLd5uqt1EHHdjfuyAb","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01LfMWLqx2K9WxBDaDiYoaR6":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='labs/game/hub/session.ts'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    hub.on('card', ((card: Session['card']) => {\"\"\",\"\"\"    // The card's keys work from the first moment: the harness sends a synthetic Enter, as soon as it sees ready.\n    addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {\n      if (this.started) return;\n      if (event.code === 'Enter' || event.code === 'NumpadEnter') this.answer('ready');\n      if (event.code === 'KeyT') this.answer('more');\n    });\n    hub.on('card', ((card: Session['card']) => {\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  engine: Engine | null = null;\n\"\"\",\"\"\"  engine: Engine | null = null;\n\n  /** Answers the card. */\n  answer(what: 'ready' | 'more'): void {\n    if (this.started) return;\n    if (what === 'ready') this.answered = true;\n    this.hub.answer(what);\n  }\n\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='labs/game/ui/app.