e map live (one per camera mode, WP 13.9), what is held read through it from the next sample;\n19: * `bindingsFor(map)`, another map's bindings, unswitched, for a controls screen (WP 13.25). A code a held binding waits\n20: * on (WP 13.20) is held back as it goes down, until it is a tap or a hold (`sample`).\n22: * Clearing: a page blur, the page going hidden and `clear()` let go of every held code and drop pending presses, so\n23: * nothing stays held after alt-tab; a gamepad that disconnects lets go of its own. `listen(device)` serves rebinding.\n25: * Invariants: nothing here reads a clock; edges are counted per sample; a code is held only between its press and\n38: * input.sample({ yaw: () => 0 }).move; // [0, 1]: still held; the camera turned, so W walks +Z now\n121:   * length 1. A code a held binding waits on (engine/input/codes.ts `Hold:<code>`, WP 13.20) is held back as it goes\n  pressed(action: string): boolean;\n  /** How far `action` was pushed at the last sample, 0 to 1. */\n  strength(action: string): number;\n  /** What the camera takes since the last call (mouse look, right stick, wheel); then zero. */\n  camera(): CameraInputSample;\n  /** The label of `action`'s binding on the device used last: `Space`, `A`, `LMB`. */\n  prompt(action: string): string;\n  /** The next code pressed on `device`'s family, swallowed; null when Escape cancels or another listen starts. */\n  listen(device: 'keyboard' | 'gamepad'): Promise<string | null>;\n  /** Lets go of everything held and drops pending presses. */\n  clear(): void;\n  /** Removes every listener. */\nengine/app/engine.ts:321:    const intents = input.sample(camera, now);\nengine/app/loop.ts:22: * // const loop = createLoop({ clock: () => run.clock, sample: (now) => input.sample(view.camera, now), step, draw, o\nengine/app/loop.ts:33:  /** The devices' intents for the frame at timestamp `now` (`input.sample(camera, now)`); `{}` when there are none. *\nengine/app/loop.ts:110:      const sampled = option