{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TsP5REmPYhjZqcA3gRtQBf","type":"tool_result","content":"+   \"Oh. That is the Gull. It likes you. It likes everyone. It is not personal.\",\n+   \"Did you sleep on your left side? You do not have to answer. I can tell. I cannot tell. Did you?\",\n+   \"Deep Knees. Pull back to sink. Do not rush. The floor is not going anywhere. Today.\",\n+   \"Is that the Gull? Flick it off. Flick the stick. Do not hit the Gull. We have rules about the Gull.\",\n+   \"Spin your stick in circles. Not too slow, not too fast. Catch what I throw. I have no arms. Do not ask.\",\n+   \"Go to the stone. It says \\\"Do not\\\". Please do. Now it is your balance. All of it.\",\n+   \"You stayed. Good morning. Everything is level. Your Morning Check is ready. It always is.\",\n+   \"The island sits on one rock. We don't mention it to guests. You're a guest. I didn't mention it. Goodnight.\",\n+   \"Your Wobble Age is {age}. Yesterday it was {before}. That is {diff} years in one night. Did you do something? You do not have to tell me.\",\n····x··\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯ Failed Tests 1 ⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\n FAIL  labs/game/scenes/audio.test.ts > the writing > has at least 200 lines, none rambling\nAssertionError: expected [ …(7) ] to deeply equal []\n- Expected\n+ Received\n- []\n+ [\n+   \"Did you sleep on your left side? You do not have to answer. I can tell. I cannot tell. Did you?\",\n+   \"Deep Knees. Pull back to sink. Do not rush. The floor is not going anywhere. Today.\",\n+   \"Spin your stick in circles. Not too slow, not too fast. Catch what I throw. I have no arms. Do not ask.\",\n+   \"Go to the stone. It says \\\"Do not\\\". Please do. Now it is your balance. All of it.\",\n+   \"You stayed. Good morning. Everything is level. Your Morning Check is ready. It always is.\",\n+   \"The island sits on one rock. We don't mention it to guests. You're a guest. I didn't mention it. Goodnight.\",\n+   \"Your Wobble Age is {age}. Yesterday it 