{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk2CvMACk1GiVdeRo2LK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U2VEbZiaoRmf6ktCs641eU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='labs/game/ui/about-data.ts'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"'About 40 across the run, from wrong ids and lint to play-breaking bugs.'\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"'About 45 across the run, from wrong ids and lint to play-breaking bugs.'\")\nm=re.search(r\"'The plan was tested on an older engine commit and client hash than I got, so some traps had moved\\.[^']*'\",s)\nassert m\ns=s.replace(m.group(0),\"'The plan was tested on an older engine commit and client hash than I got, so some of its details had moved. Its rule of two short sentences a line sits beside seed lines of five.'\")\nm=re.search(r\"\\[\\s*'What was the most helpful test you ran\\?',\\s*'[^']*',\\s*\\],\",s)\nassert m\ns=s.replace(m.group(0),\"\"\"[\n    'What was the most helpful test you ran?',\n    'The scripted playthrough of the whole game with the human-like bot, which proved no softlock on three seeds and found the mid-step crash, and the page drive to the credits with one kind of input, which found the Programme loop and the Carry on bug that the sim could not see.',\n  ],\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"## What worked well\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"\"\"13. **An actor placed every step reads as falling.** `placeActor` resets the controller's state, so the animator shows the\n    airborne stance: arms out, knees bent, for anyone held on a mat. It looked like an odd idle until I saw it in a session.\n    I give held people a neutral two-key strip. A `placeActor(..., { grounded: true })` would be the honest fix.\n\n\"\"\"+a)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='labs/game/README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"- **Outward or costly things:**\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"\"\"- **The press that closes a screen stays out of play** until it is let go: \"Carry on\" with Cross would otherwise also count as\n  \"use\" on whatever you stand beside, and drop you straight back into the activity.\n\"\"\"+a)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"## Status\")\nb=s.index(\"## Test tally\")\ns=s[:a]+\"\"\"## Status (08:40 Nov 5)\n- All code final. verify: previous full run 24/25 (only a memory-killed worker on hoop; hoop passes alone). Final full run in background: out/verify.log.\n- After verify is clean: `node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs ../TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601.html`; `node labs/game/tools/exit-interview.mjs ../exit-interview.json`; remove out/ ; final chat reply with Source Info + feedback from labs/game/ui/about-data.ts.\n\n\"\"\"+s[b:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnpx prettier --write labs/game/ui/about-data.ts >/dev/null; git -C . status --short . 2>/dev/null | head -1 | cut -c1-60; export CHROMIUM_PATH=$HOME/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell; echo ok","description":"Finalize the reports' text and progress notes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":939142,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dd98077-2f1f-4b79-bf36-2031f176f317","uuid":"9c6fd1de-ac35-42b9-ba42-6a040de605f7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T15:31:39.890Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk2Cuw7XE9EzQcUP2Siz","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01U2VEbZiaoRmf6ktCs641eU":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='lab