{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wgw4K3zXk2bUB3NX91mdEY","type":"tool_result","content":"/**\n * @file The tilt as a force: while the Great Tilt runs, every walker gets a downhill push. The island's geome\n * moves (PLAN.md section 7); the slope pushes, the camera banks and the sea counter-rotates.\n *\n * Game code, sim-side.\n *\n * @example\n * // const [px, pz] = tiltPushFor(w, x, z);\n */\nimport type { GameWorld } from './components';\nimport { islandOf } from './flow';\n\n/** How much of the walker's speed a degree of tilt takes. */\nconst PUSH_PER_DEGREE = 0.055;\n\n/** The downhill push on a walker, as a share of its move. The story tilt is too small to push. */\nexport function tiltPushFor(w: GameWorld, _x: number, _z: number): [number, number] {\n  const { tiltX, tiltZ } = islandOf(w);\n  return [tiltX * PUSH_PER_DEGREE, tiltZ * PUSH_PER_DEGREE];\n}\nok labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts 2\nok tilt import\nok scenes/tilt\nlabs/game/scenes/events/step.ts 166ms\nlabs/game/scenes/wired.test.ts 23ms\nlabs/game/ui/app.ts 79ms\nlabs/game/scenes/tilt.ts 6ms\nlabs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts 60ms (unchanged)\nlabs/game/ui/hud/seatDiscs.ts 15ms (unchanged)\nlabs/game/ui/frame.ts 44ms (unchanged)\n  394 labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts\n  301 labs/game/scenes/events/step.ts\n  262 labs/game/scenes/events/plunge.ts\n  329 labs/game/ui/frame.ts\n  390 labs/game/ui/app.ts\n 1676 total\n\n> teeter@0.0.0 check\n> node tools/checkAll.ts\n\nChecking formatting...\nAll matched files use Prettier code style!\nx check: ok: 3 plugins: all pass\nassets: ok, 2288 files, 0 binary (0 approved, 0 fonts)\nengine: ok, my-3dge@2dbd829, 2135 files\nevals: ok, 0 tasks\nreport: out/check/all/report.json\ncheck: ok in 18.8 s\ncheck exit 0\n\n RUN  v4.1.12 /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601\n\n··················\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\