he width with the picture: `width` px at this many lines, in whole pixels; 0 doesn't.\",\n      0,\n      0,\n      2160,\n    ),\n    darken: num('The line is the surface times this (0 is black), unless a colour is given.', 0.35, 0, 1),\n    color: {\n      type: 'string',\n      default: '',\n      unit: COLOR_UNIT,\n      description: \"The line's colour: hex ('#1a1a2e') or a CSS colour name ('black'); '' darkens the surface instead.\",\n    },\n    depth: num('The depth jump that makes an edge, as a share of the distance.', 0.02, 0.001, 1),\n    crease: num('Neighbouring normals whose dot product falls below this make an edge.', 0.6, -1, 1),\n    fade: num('How much the lines fade with distance, 0 to 1, from fadeStart to fadeEnd.', 0, 0, 1),\n    fadeStart: num('Where the lines start to fade.', 25, 0, 500, 'm'),\n    fadeEnd: num('Where they have faded by `fade`.', 120, 1, 2000, 'm'),\n    wobble: num('How far the lines wobble, hand-drawn, in pixels at 1080 lines.', 0, 0, 4, 'px'),\n    boil: num('How many times a second the wobble is redrawn (line boil); 0 keeps it still.', 0, 0, 24),\n== game look\n55-  grade: { scope: 'all', brightness: 1.08, saturation: 0.92, lift: 0.03 },\n56:  outline: { scope: 'characters+objects', width: 1, darken: 0.25, fade: 1, fadeStart: 90, fadeEnd: 400 },\n57-};\n58-\n59-defineLook('look:retreat', {\n--\n83-    grade: { scope: 'all', brightness: 0.86, saturation: 0.45, lift: 0.01 },\n84:    outline: { scope: 'characters+objects', width: 1, darken: 0.35, fade: 1, fadeStart: 60, fadeEnd: 260 },\n85-  },\n86-} as never);\n== scopes\nengine/gfx/post/presetsMore.ts\nengine/gfx/post/presets.ts\nengine/gfx/post/chain.ts\nengine/gfx/post/filterFieldsMore.ts\nengine/gfx/post/grid.ts\nengine/gfx/post/filterFields.ts\nengine/gfx/post/mrt.ts\nengine/gfx/post/filters.ts\nengine/gfx/post/filterSchema.ts:13: * scopeMask('characters+objects'); // 3\nengine/gfx/post/filterSchema.ts:25:  'objects',\nengine/gfx/post/filterSchema.ts:27:  'characters+ob