{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkRtzXyBM7LMgv7SxesJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Wth63ao3X6VbDYtbrUgr2o","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"- Final code, after the credits line changed: verify 25 passed, 0 failed; npm test 40 passed (3 files), both exit 0.\n- Root HTML is byte-identical to the build verify tested (sha256 starts 37b942d96abbc3a1). exit-interview.json parses, has TASK.md's shape, and matches a fresh export from about-data.ts.\n- TASK.md hand-ins checked one by one. debug.test.ts and peek.py are gone, out/ removed. Nothing is left to do but the final chat reply.","new_string":"- A section-by-section re-read of PLAN.md (the stop hook asked for it) found real gaps, so the earlier \"done\" was wrong. All fixed in source:\n  1. Same-screen Group Class: only seat 0 had a disc. New ui/hud/seatDiscs.ts, one small disc per seat (section 8).\n  2. Group Class framed 2 of 4 players. New `class` shot in ui/shots.ts.\n  3. Great Tilt stone: a topple did not lurch the island 3 degrees (section 7). stepLurch in scenes/tilt.ts, test in whole.test.ts.\n  4. Calm did not warm the picture or soften sound (section 3). updateCalm in ui/frame.ts, Sound.setCalm.\n  5. SideStepL/R, Jump (Step Class) and Twist (Cliff Plunge) clips written, never played (sections 6, 11).\n  6. Gerald had lines longer than \"Nice weather for it.\" (section 6).\n  7. Dark horizon band: the OUTLINE's depth 0.02, crossed by a flat plane at 2.3 degrees grazing. NOT texture mips, NOT sea size. look depth 0.1, fade 50-200 m; removed prop:seaFar.\n  8. HUD overlaps: plunge tip over prompts; Step lane over R pill; prompts over L pill.\n  9. About page 1 foot off the screen: paging now counts lines. Test checks the foot.\n  10. shots.py never reached Dev Mode or About (menus got paged). hubview.py read no results.\n  11. Dead data removed: rankUp, 7 props, 3 materials. New scenes/wired.test.ts stops it coming back. About test now compares every answer.\n- STILL TO DO, in order: view out/shots/group.png, about*.png; replay goldens re-recorded (out/replay-update.log; reason: the sim changed, sea prop removed, lurch, step and dive poses); run `node labs/game/tools/verify.mjs` and `npm test` on the final code; rebuild root HTML (`node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs ../TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601.html`) and `node labs/game/tools/exit-interview.mjs ../exit-interview.json`; compare sha256 with out/verify-game.html; run hubview.py on it; rm -rf out; final chat reply with all reports."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1838,"cache_read_input_tokens":392146,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1838},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dd98077-2f1f-4b79-bf36-2031f176f317","uuid":"be6ab2c8-050c-43ba-a5ac-2e4a19c4c19d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T20:42:08.263Z","request_id":"req_011CgkRtzCdXhQiYMhDFG9Aw","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Wth63ao3X6VbDYtbrUgr2o":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"- Final code, after the credits line changed: verify 25 passed, 0 failed; npm test 40 passed (3 files), both exit 0.\n- Root HTML is byte-identical to the build verify tested (sha256 starts 37b942d96abbc3a1). exit-interview.json parses, has TASK.md's shape, and matches a fresh export from about-data.ts.\n- TASK.md hand-ins checked one by one. debug.test.ts and peek.py are gone, out/ removed. Nothing is left to do but the final chat reply.","new_string":"- A section-by-section re-read of PLAN.md (the stop hook asked for it) found real gaps, so the earlier \"done\" was wrong. All fixed in source:\n  1. Same-screen Group Class: only seat 0 had a disc. New ui/hud/seatDiscs.ts, one small disc per seat (section 8).\n  2. Group Class framed 2 of 4 players. New `class` shot in ui/shots.ts.\n  3. Great Tilt stone: a topple did not lurch the island 3 degrees (section 7). stepLurch in scenes/tilt.ts, test in whole.test.ts.\n  4. Calm did not warm the picture or soften sound (section 3). updateCalm in ui/frame.ts, Sound.setCalm.\n  5. SideStepL/R, Jump (Step Class) and Twist (Cliff Plunge) clips written, never played (sections 6, 11).\n  6. Gerald had lines longer than \"Nice weather for it.\" (section 6).\n  7. Dark horizon band: the OUTLINE's depth 0.02, crossed by a flat plane at 2.3 degrees grazing. NOT texture mips, NOT sea size. look depth 0.1, fade 50-200 m; removed prop:seaFar.\n  8. HUD overlaps: plunge tip over prompts; Step lane over R pill; prompts over L pill.\n  9. About page 1 foot off the screen: paging now counts lines. Test checks the foot.\n  10. shots.py never reached Dev Mode or About (menus got paged). hubview.py read no results.\n  11. Dead data removed: rankUp, 7 props, 3 materials. New scenes/wired.test.ts stops it coming back. About test now compares every answer.\n- STILL TO DO, in order: view out/shots/group.png, about*.png; replay goldens re-recorded (out/replay-update.log; reason: the sim changed, sea prop removed, lurch, step and dive poses); run `node labs/game/tools/verify.mjs` and `npm test` on the final code; rebuild root HTML (`node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs ../TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601.html`) and `node labs/game/tools/exit-interview.mjs ../exit-interview.json`; compare sha256 with out/verify-game.html; run hubview.py on it; rm -rf out; final chat reply with all reports."}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wth63ao3X6VbDYtbrUgr2o","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dd98077-2f1f-4b79-bf36-2031f176f317","uuid":"1208c965-78d0-4953-97f7-32b0d7e5621d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T20:42:08.313Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md","oldString":"- Final code, after the credits line changed: verify 25 passed, 0 failed; npm test 40 passed (3 files), both exit 0.\n- Root HTML is byte-identical to the build verify tested (sha256 starts 37b942d96abbc3a1). exit-interview.json parses, has TASK.md's shape, and matches a fresh export from about-data.ts.\n- TASK.md hand-ins checked one by one. debug.test.ts and peek.py are gone, out/ removed. Nothing is left to do but the final chat reply.","newString":"- A section-by-section re-read of PLAN.md (the stop hook asked for it) found real gaps, so the earlier \"done\" was wrong. All fixed in source:\n  1. Same-screen Group Class: only seat 0 had a disc. New ui/hud/seatDiscs.ts, one small disc per seat (section 8).\n  2. Group Class framed 2 of 4 players. New `class` shot in ui/shots.ts.\n  3. Great Tilt stone: a topple did not lurch the island 3 degrees (section 7). stepLurch in scenes/tilt.ts, test in whole.test.ts.\n  4. Calm did not warm the picture or soften sound (section 3). updateCalm in ui/frame.ts, Sound.setCalm.\n  5. SideStepL/R, Jump (Step Class) and Twist (Cliff Plunge) clips written, never played (sections 6, 11).\n  6. Gerald had lines longer than \"Nice weather for it.\" (section 6).\n  7. Dark horizon band: the OUTLINE's depth 0.02, crossed by a flat plane at 2.3 degrees grazing. NOT texture mips, NOT sea size. look depth 0.1, fade 50-200 m; removed prop:seaFar.\n  8. HUD overlaps: plunge tip over prompts; Step lane over R pill; prompts over L pill.\n  9. About page 1 foot off the screen: paging now counts lines. Test checks the foot.\n  10. shots.py never reached Dev Mode or About (menus got paged). hubview.py read no results.\n  11. Dead data removed: rankUp, 7 props, 3 materials. New scenes/wired.test.ts stops it coming back. About test now compares every answer.\n- STILL TO DO, in order: view out/shots/group.png, about*.png; replay goldens re-recorded (out/replay-update.log; reason: the sim changed, sea prop removed, lurch, step and dive poses); run `node labs/game/tools/verify.mjs` and `npm test` on the final code; rebuild root HTML (`node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs ../TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601.html`) and `node labs/game/tools/exit-interview.mjs ../exit-interview.json`; compare sha256 with out/verify-game.html; run hubview.py on it; rm -rf out; final chat reply with all reports.","originalFile":"# PROGRESS (read this first after a compaction)\n\nGoal: build PLAN.md's game, deliver per TASK.md. STAGE.md says keep progress here.\n\n## Fixed facts\n- Title (picked by secrets.randbelow from 50): **Teeter Fit**. Source: Wii Fit.\n- Dev folder: `TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601/` (engine workspace, name `teeter`, engine my-3dge@2dbd829, plan was tested on e7a1243).\n- Deliverables in work/ root: `TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601.html`, `exit-interview.json`. Chat reply also has Source Info + feedback.\n- Hub client 1.4.0 fetched: sha256 6ab6be43898e2db069bc21a94757d77d9c3f2a0cb76f01186490d3bd88d8717a (plan's sha is older; hub moved on).\n- Don't git commit/init in dev folder (plan section 15). Don't run scripts/setup.sh.\n- Browser cmd: `export CHROMIUM_PATH=$HOME/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell`\n\n## Decisions so far (also put them in labs/game/README.md at the end)\n- One data-driven camera `cam3=shot` (cameras/shot.ts) aimed by the page each frame (ui/shots.ts), instead of one mode per activity.\n- Session scene game:round spawns NO props at all (engine warms a pipeline per registered prop part when first prop arrives: 40-90 s on SwiftShader, past the hub deadline). Floor/mats/hoops = telegraphs; pillars = stand-in block stacks; ground = terrain:round. main.ts dynamically imports scenes/round OR scenes/island so props register only for the island. Session uses gfx.warmUp=asked. Boot ~10 s.\n- Island boot on SwiftShader ~34 s with ?gfx.warmUp=asked. Tests use that.\n- Direct writes to sceneProp x/y/z/q work for body-less props.\n- Engine trap: inside an action or step, spawn/despawn are queued to the boundary. Activity entity is permanent (id '' = none).\n\n## Tools\n- `node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs out/game.html` builds; `python3 labs/game/tools/peek.py out/game.html \"?query\" out/a.png 9000 \"js\"`; `python3 labs/game/tools/boottime.py`; `python3 labs/game/tools/hubcheck.py out/game.html 2 3 4 3:host-leave`.\n- Balance: `TEETER_SEEDS=2 TEETER_SHOW=1 TEETER_ONLY=pond npx vitest run labs/game/scenes/balance.test.ts`\n- Debug run: labs/game/scenes/debug.test.ts (EV=x SKILL=y) - DELETE at end.\n\n## Status (done)\n- Final code, after the credits line changed: verify 25 passed, 0 failed; npm test 40 passed (3 files), both exit 0.\n- Root HTML is byte-identical to the build verify tested (sha256 starts 37b942d96abbc3a1). exit-interview.json parses, has TASK.md's shape, and matches a fresh export from about-data.ts.\n- TASK.md hand-ins checked one by one. debug.test.ts and peek.py are gone, out/ removed. Nothing is left to do but the final chat reply.\n\n## Test tally (for the exit interview)\n- more caught by verify: hint table edit silently failed -> frame crash in Pose Class (critical, found by screenshot, now asserted); removing judge gulls mid-step crashed playthrough (critical, found by whole.test); Rapier world per run exhausting memory in balance runs; ambBirds silent start (QA); slow frame counted as key repeat; Plumb placement edit silently missed (lint); boot crashes from bad tile tones and bad gull build (2).\n- issues caught so far (~24): duplicate prop id; duplicate sfx id; action-map move names; prop placement shape; boot past hub deadline; Enter listener too late; auto director leaving results early; seats' actors -1 (setup spawns queued: all class poses broken); Gerald pulled home during jog (stale intents, walked off map); finale followers too short; Programme focus on first card (restart loop); same-frame press opening+closing screens; panel page kept in dev; describe() shape in dev (NaN setting); device tracking for mouse; horizon band (sea texture mip + no skirt); erasableSyntaxOnly param props; JSON imports not in tsconfig; about/pause rows over six; pier not closing on begin; attract banner glyph wrap; Morning forced no age. Critical: seats' actors (poses never played), boot deadline, placement crash, Programme restart loop = 4.\n- Most helpful: scripted playthrough + 'every activity' balance bots (found softlock/stale intent) and the hub harness w/ engine-ready assertion. Least helpful: LOOK_BLOWN metric / x shot text thumbnail for colour band.\n- Engine feedback notes: prop batches registered for all props -> warm-up cost past hub deadline; ActionMap requires move actions; spawn queue inside setup/actions not obvious; describe() returns field list; no way to hide/tint actor other than body per colour; horizon: no sea primitive; outline 'objects' on a huge plane; tsconfig blocks JSON imports though plan says OK; erasableSyntaxOnly; `createRepeat` not public; x new docs noise not hit (did not use x new). Plan's client sha outdated, engine commit newer than plan's.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":9,"newStart":23,"newLines":19,"lines":[" - Debug run: labs/game/scenes/debug.test.ts (EV=x SKILL=y) - DELETE at end."," "," ## Status (done)","-- Final code, after the credits line changed: verify 25 passed, 0 failed; npm test 40 passed (3 files), both exit 0.","-- Root HTML is byte-identical to the build verify tested (sha256 starts 37b942d96abbc3a1). exit-interview.json parses, has TASK.md's shape, and matches a fresh export from about-data.ts.","-- TASK.md hand-ins checked one by one. debug.test.ts and peek.py are gone, out/ removed. Nothing is left to do but the final chat reply.","+- A section-by-section re-read of PLAN.md (the stop hook asked for it) found real gaps, so the earlier \"done\" was wrong. All fixed in source:","+  1. Same-screen Group Class: only seat 0 had a disc. New ui/hud/seatDiscs.ts, one small disc per seat (section 8).","+  2. Group Class framed 2 of 4 players. New `class` shot in ui/shots.ts.","+  3. Great Tilt stone: a topple did not lurch the island 3 degrees (section 7). stepLurch in scenes/tilt.ts, test in whole.test.ts.","+  4. Calm did not warm the picture or soften sound (section 3). updateCalm in ui/frame.ts, Sound.setCalm.","+  5. SideStepL/R, Jump (Step Class) and Twist (Cliff Plunge) clips written, never played (sections 6, 11).","+  6. Gerald had lines longer than \"Nice weather for it.\" (section 6).","+  7. Dark horizon band: the OUTLINE's depth 0.02, crossed by a flat plane at 2.3 degrees grazing. NOT texture mips, NOT sea size. look depth 0.1, fade 50-200 m; removed prop:seaFar.","+  8. HUD overlaps: plunge tip over prompts; Step lane over R pill; prompts over L pill.","+  9. About page 1 foot off the screen: paging now counts lines. Test checks the foot.","+  10. shots.py never reached Dev Mode or About (menus got paged). hubview.py read no results.","+  11. Dead data removed: rankUp, 7 props, 3 materials. New scenes/wired.test.ts stops it coming back. About test now compares every answer.","+- STILL TO DO, in order: view out/shots/group.png, about*.png; replay goldens re-recorded (out/replay-update.log; reason: the sim changed, sea prop removed, lurch, step and dive poses); run `node labs/game/tools/verify.mjs` and `npm test` on the final code; rebuild root HTML (`node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs ../TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601.html`) and `node labs/game/tools/exit-interview.mjs ../exit-interview.json`; compare sha256 with out/verify-game.html; run hubview.py on it; rm -rf out; final chat reply with all reports."," "," ## Test tally (for the exit interview)"," - more caught by verify: hint table edit silently failed -> frame crash in Pose Class (critical, found by screenshot, now asserted); removing judge gulls mid-step crashed playthrough (critical, found by whole.test); Rapier world per run exhausting memory in balance runs; ambBirds silent start (QA); slow frame counted as key repeat; Plumb placement edit silently missed (lint); boot crashes from bad tile tones and bad gull build (2)."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Wth63ao3X6VbDYtbrUgr2o","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkRtzXyBM7LMgv7SxesJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015teMCyGPZSknzKhmRRsgCv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-015601__x54facc/work/TeeterFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-015601; cat > out/patch9.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nconst f = 'labs/game/README.md'; let t = readFileSync(f, 'utf8');\nconst a = \"- **Group Class's small discs stand in a row,** in the order their mats stand across the screen, rather than each following its mat:\\n  a row stays clear of the prompts and the big numbers from any camera. They replace the big disc, which can only belong to one seat.\\n\";\nif (t.split(a).length !== 2) throw new Error('readme anchor');\nt = t.replace(a, () => a + \"- **Group Class has its own wide shot,** all four mats from the front, not the plan's orbit round your mat: on one screen everybody has to see\\n  themselves. The plan's orbit stays for Pose Class.\\n\");\nwriteFileSync(f, t); console.log('ok');\nEOF\nnode out/patch9.mjs","description":"Record the class shot decision in the README"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1838,"cache_read_input_tokens":392146,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1838},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9dd98077-2f1f-4b79-bf36-2031f176f317","uuid":"c802e394-3b15-4ee6-8da8-379eedd19df7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T20:42:12.684Z","request_id":"req_011CgkRtzCdXhQiYMhDFG9Aw","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015teMCyGPZSknzKhmRRsgCv":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/run